  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c85e095cc882972f",
      "translationZh": "本次发布新增了许多音频模型，以及一种在本地比较这些模型的新方式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50abceb72479da39",
      "translationZh": "Audio.cpp 现在已涵盖 62 个模型家族和 85+ 个模型变体，而且还在不断增加！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "466a8293cef164d7",
      "translationZh": "面向用户的最大变化是全新的 Arena UI。你不再需要一次只测试一个模型，现在可以提供一份共用输入，将多个本地模型或 GGUF 变体加入队列，然后并排比较生成的输出。这有助于你在不同模型之间做出选择，而不必编写一大堆脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05909abade839b67",
      "translationZh": "免责声明：这些 RTF 数值来自使用当前 audio.cpp 实现（加上服务器开销）的冷启动单次请求，因此不要将它们当作模型排行榜。如果某个模型较慢，可能只是意味着我的实现仍需优化。目的是帮助你在本地尝试一批模型，比较输出，并选出你最喜欢的那个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ed0f297e24ff540",
      "translationZh": "TTS / 语音：FireRedTTS3、MagpieTTS、PersonaPlex、F5-TTS / Habibi、MOSS VoiceGenerator、DotTTS Edit",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a42384114766db93",
      "translationZh": "ASR / 语音理解：FireRedAudio、IBM Granite Speech 5.0 TurboCTC、MMS Forced Aligner",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33b8c3edec1c1f68",
      "translationZh": "语音转换：MeanVC2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f76b7dfc0553149",
      "translationZh": "音乐 / 音频生成：MiniMax Music 3、MiDashengLM-Gen、ControlFoley（实验性）、ACE-Step 1.5 XL 变体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5edeb050d0b8cfef",
      "translationZh": "许多新增的模型支持都得益于贡献者帮助我们快速让模型运行起来，有时甚至几乎在模型发布的第一天就完成了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6cab12a4e4ccb8da",
      "translationZh": "最让我兴奋的是看到 audio.cpp 在真实的边缘硬件上运行良好：我们的贡献者 https://github.com/Hi5808 在 NVIDIA Jetson Orin 上测试了 audio.cpp：在 Orin NX 16GB 上，40/40 个模型系列都能正常运行，没有问题；在 Orin Nano 8GB 上则有 34/40 个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "392e41e5fc89dbb5",
      "translationZh": "我们的预编译版本现在覆盖 Windows CPU、Windows Vulkan、Windows CUDA 12.4、Windows CUDA 13.3、Ubuntu x64 CPU、Ubuntu x64 Vulkan、macOS arm64 Metal、macOS x64 CPU。感谢 https://github.com/drzsdrtfg 添加了自动化预编译工作流，让我不必再手动构建发布版本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "585daf1635796fbc",
      "translationZh": "最后，非常欢迎大家贡献！如果你对本地音频 AI、模型集成、性能、部署、UI，或者只是用自己的硬件做些测试感兴趣，我都非常希望你能参与进来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e6ac730f074e381",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Acceptable-Cycle4645 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
